You equip your mecharachnid with a stormcoil generator, a mechanical device that projects a powerful electrical field. On taking a hit greater than 15% of its maximum life, the excess damage will be reduced by [6%, 29%, 42%, 51%, 58% (TL1-5)] and converted into energy, giving your mecharachnid [7%, 15%, 20%, 23%, 26% (TL1-5)] increased global speed for 2 turns.
